DARD>\nBaamtou ko lou bari yone, nga dindi beup khalaate ci sam khele té bayi sa yarame ni teuké.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2023,"row":{"en":"Funny pictures and videos are a dime a dozen these days, but some of them stand out from the rest.","wo":"Wideo wala nataal yu xoromu ñooy lëmbe fan yii, waaye amna ci yu gëna xoromu yeneen yi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nVideo walla nataal you khoromou gnoy leumbé fane yii wayé amna thi you geuna khoromou yénéne yi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2024,"row":{"en":"The reason is the fear of failure to match the expectations of the teacher.","wo":"Sabab bi mooy ragal a ñàkka mëna matal li jàngalekat bi di xaar ci yaw.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSabab bi moy ragal a niaka meuna matal li diangalekat bi di khar thi yaw.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2025,"row":{"en":"Execute engaging marketing campaigns to drive brand awareness, generate leads, and grow customer prospect engagement.","wo":"Defal ay kàmpaañu fësal njaay yu am solo suko defee nit ñi gëna xam màrk bi, defar ay prospekt ngir gëna xëcc ay kiliyaan yu bees.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDefal ay kampagnou feusal ndiaay you am solo souko défé nitt gni geuna kham mark bi, defar ay prospect nguir geuna heuth ay kilian you bess.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2026,"row":{"en":"We can bring our own reusable bags when we go shopping, and we can recycle plastic bags whenever possible.","wo":"Mën nanu jëfandikoo sac bu nuy faral di yóbbu nduggi, te mën nanu jëfandikoowaat sac plastik saa yunu ko mënee.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMeun nagnou dieufandiko sac bougnouy faral di yobou ndougui té meun nagnou dieufandikowate sac plastik saa yougnou ko meuneé.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2027,"row":{"en":"If you're not comfortable doing these things yourself, you can take your car to a qualified mechanic.","wo":"Sudee danga am jafe-jafe defal ko sa bopp, mën nga yóbbu sa oto ci mekanisien bu xarañ.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSudé danga ame diafé diafé défal ko sa bopp, meune nga yobou sa auto thi mécanicien bou kharagn.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2028,"row":{"en":"During their extended game of tag, one of them darted inside a small cave near the summit of an unknown hill.","wo":"Bi ñuy gëna yokk seen etiketu jeu kenn ci ñoom dafa dugg ci grotte fu soriwul noonu collu tundu wuñu xamul turam.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBi gnuy geuna yok seen etiquette jeu, kene ci gnom dafa doug thi grotte fou soriwoul nonou collou toundou wugnu khamoul tourame.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2029,"row":{"en":"The couple, a renowned linguist and a world-renowned pastry chef, had been trying for a baby for years.","wo":"Jëkkër ak jabar la, jëkkër ji di tekkikatu làkk bu siiw jabar ji patisiyeer, ay at a ngi nii ñu bëgga am doom mënul sotti.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDieukeure ak djabar la, dieukeure dji di teukikatou lak bou siiw djabar dji patissier, ay att a ngui nii gnou beuga ame dome meunoul sotti.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2030,"row":{"en":"His daughter, Marcela, was listening to music that he didn't approve of.","wo":"Doomam Marcela dafa doon déglu music buko neexul.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDomame marcela dafa done deglou music bouko nekhoul\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2031,"row":{"en":"When tissue is damaged, it releases chemicals that attract white blood cells and other immune cells to the area.","wo":"Su tisu bi yàqoo, dafay bàyyi substance yuy woo seluli deret yu weex yi ak yeneen selul imuniteer ci barab bi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSou tissu bi yakoo dafay bayi substance youy woo selouli deret you wekh yi ak yenen selul imuniteer si barab bi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2032,"row":{"en":"Dude, you won't believe this.","wo":"Saa waay,