ngee ci sunuy njuumte, nu jaare fa gëna dëgër.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDafnouy may niou diangué si souniou ndioumté, niou diarée fa gueuna deugeur.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2039,"row":{"en":"god bless you","wo":"yal na la Yàlla sàmm","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nYalla nala yalla samm\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2040,"row":{"en":"When we cook dinner for our children, we are not only providing them with nourishment, but we are also spending time with them and teaching them about the importance of food and family.","wo":"Sunuy toggal sunuy doom reer, yamu nu ci jox leen ñu lekk, waaye ginaaw loolu yaa ngi nekk ak ñoom ab diir, yaa ngi leen di jàngal solo si nekk ñam ak njaboot.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSougnouy togal sougnouy doom rére, yamou gnou si diokh léne gnou leke, wayé guinaw lolou ya ngui neke ak gnom ab diir, ya ngui léne di diangal solo si neke gniam ak ndiabote.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2041,"row":{"en":"Panic struck like a lightning bolt, and he stood up and whirled around, taking stock of the boundaries of his prison.","wo":"Dafa jekki rek tiit ni bëréet, jog taxaw xool liko wër, gis ni kaso biñu ko tëj tollu.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDafa djéki rek tiit ni beuret, djog takhaw khol liko weur, guiss ni kasso bignou ko teudj tollou.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2042,"row":{"en":"After her son died, Mary found herself shifting artistically.","wo":"Ginaaw bi doomam génnee àdduna Mary dafa mujjee dugg ci wàllu art.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nGinaaw bii domam guéné aduna mary dafa moudié dougg si wallou art bi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2043,"row":{"en":"Global growth should remain fairly robust by post-crisis standards throughout the forecast period.","wo":"Yokkateg àdduna bi dafa wéy di am doole ginaaw jafe-jafe yi topp ci diir bi ñu séentu.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nYokateg addouna bi dafa way di ame dolé guinaw diafé diafé yi top thi dir bi niou sentou.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2044,"row":{"en":"The oysters were delicious, and I washed them down with a glass of crisp white wine.","wo":"Yéet yi neexoon nañu lool, teg ci ma sotti benn kaasu vin blanc bu foor.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nYétt yi nékhone nagnou lole, tegue ci ma sotti béne kaassou vin blanc bou foor.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2045,"row":{"en":"I arranged them in a vase and set them on the table next to her bed.","wo":"Ma dugal leen ci benn vase ba noppi ma teg ko ci taabal ji ci wetu lalam.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMa dougal len ci bene vase ba noppi ma teg ko ci table dji ci wetou lalamé.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2046,"row":{"en":"Return the pan to the stove, lower the heat to medium, and cook the mushrooms, onions, and garlic until tender.","wo":"Dellool poel bi ci fuur bi, nga wàññi gaas bi bamu yam, nga togg champignon yi, soble bi ak laaj bi bañu nooy.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDellou poel bi si four bi, nga wagnii gaas bi bamou yam, nga tog champignon yi, soble bi ak ladj bi bagnou noyé.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2047,"row":{"en":"Island-ripe pineapple, apple, stone fruit, and crisp pear fill the mouth.","wo":"Ananaasu ile bu ñor, pomme, meññeef yu am xoox wala peche fees nañu gémmiñ.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nAnanass ile bou gnior, pomme, meugneuf you ame khoh wala peche fess nagnou guemign.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2048,"row":{"en":"This has led to a number of new discoveries, as researchers are able to compare photos from different sources and identify previously unknown individuals.","wo":"Loolu tax na ñu gis mbir yu bees yu bari, ndax leegi gëstukat yi mën nañu méngale nataal yu bawoo ci yeneen balluwaay ba noppi xàmmee nit ñuñ xamul woon.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLolou takh na gnou guiss mbir you bess you bari ndakh légui guestoukat yi meun nagnou mengalé natal you bawoo si yénéne balluwaay ba noppi khamé nitt gnougnou khamoul wone.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2049,"row":{"en":"The shoots grow upwards towards the sun, and the leaves begin to photosynthesize, producing food for the plant.","wo":"Gàñcax gu ndaw gi tàmbali wuti jant ba, xob yi tàmbali photosynthese biy defar ñamu gàñcax bi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nGancakh gou ndaw gui tambali wouti djant ba khob yi tambali photosynthèse bii defar niamou gancakh bi\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2050,"row":{"en":"She also uses her skills as a hacker to infiltrate the nationalists' computers and steal their data.","wo":"Dafay jëfandikoo xam-xamam itam ngir yëddu ordinatëri nationalist yi jël seeni done.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDafay dieufandiko kham khamam itam nguir yeuddou ordinateur yi nationaliste dieul seni données.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2051,"row":{"en":"In the 16th century, Ethiopia was invaded by the Ottoman Empire, but the Ethiopians were able to defeat the Ottomans and maintain their independence.","wo":"Ci xarnu 16, ci la Empire Ottoman dugg biir Ethiopie, waaye waa Ethiopie ñoo mujjee am ndam ci kaw Ottoman yi, ba noppi wéy di moom seen bopp.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nThi kharnou 16, thila empire ottoman dougg biir ethiopie, wayé wa ethiopie gno mujjé am ndam thi kaw ottoman yi, ba nopi way di moom sen bopp.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2052,"row":{"en":"The universe was a vast, empty void.","wo":"Univers bi dafa yaatuwoon, ba noppi amul dara.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nUnivers bi dafa yaatouwone ba noppi amoul dara rk.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2053,"row":{"en":"As she stood on the podium, her national anthem played, and she waved to the cheering crowd.","wo":"Bimu taxawee ci pojëm bi ñu tegal ko bàkku réewam, mu tàllal loxo mbooloo mi kontaan di yuuxu.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBimou takhawé thi pojeme bi niou teugal ko bakou réwam, mou tallal lokho mbollo mi contane di youkhou.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2054,"row":{"en":"My family has always kept animals.","wo":"Sama famiy dañu yàgga yar baayima.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSama famille daniou yague yar bayima\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2055,"row":{"en":"When the water droplets in the clouds become too heavy, they fall as rain.","wo":"Su peppu ndox yi nekk ci niir yi diisee lool, dañuy wàcci nekk taw.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSou peppou ndokh yi nekk thi niir yi diissé loool, dagnouy wathie nekk taw.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2056,"row":{"en":"Doctor: Hello, and welcome to your annual checkup.","wo":"Doktër: Nanga def, dalal jàmm ngir def sa bilan at mi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDocteur: Nan nga def dalal diam nguir def sa bilan at mi\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2057,"row":{"en":"Provides samples of tumors, survival rates, and Medical care records.","wo":"Dafay joxe misaali tumër, tóo limu mucc, ak done yu ñeel liñ faj.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDafay djoxé missalii tumeur, too limou mouthie ak doné you gnél lini fadje.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2058,"row":{"en":"hurricane","wo":"taw bu àndak ngelaw","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\ntaw bou andak nguelaw\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2059,"row":{"en":"The challenging academic courses I took taught me the importance of hard work and perseverance, and the extracurricular activities I participated in taught me the value of teamwork and dedication.","wo":"Kuuri universite yima def itam jàngal nañu ma njariñu liggéey bu metti ak baña xàddi mukk, yeneen xeeti njàngale yu génn klaas yima daan bokk ñoo ma jàngal solo si ci bokk liggéey ak fonk sa liggéey.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKouri université yima def itame diangal nagnou ma ndiarignou ligueye bou meti ak bagna khaddi mouk, yenen kheuti diangale you guenn classe yima dane bokk nio ma diangal solo si ci bok ligueye ak fonk sa ligueye.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2060,"row":{"en":"It’s a well-crafted story that will stay with you long after you’ve finished watching it.","wo":"Ni ñu nasee jaar-jaar bi jaar na yoon, te booko seetaanee dina des ci sa xel lu yàgg.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nNignou nasé jaar jaar bi jaar na yone té bokko sétané dina dess thi sa hel lou yague.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2061,"row":{"en":"He had been planning this trip for weeks, ever since he had seen the advertisement in the paper.","wo":"Bimu dalee waajal tukki bi matna ay ayu-bis, bamu gisee pub bi ci benn surnaal.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBimou dalé wadial touki bi matna ay ayou-bisse, bamou guissé pub bi thi bene surnal.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2062,"row":{"en":"But then she met Hakim.","wo":"Ci noonu la dajee ak Hakim.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nThi nonou la dadié ak Hakim.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2063,"row":{"en":"Comments on this article reflect the sole opinions of their writers.","wo":"Xalaat yi si bataaxal bii dafay fësal xalaatu ñi ko bind.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKhalat yi si bataakhal bii dafay feusal khalaatou gni ko bind.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2064,"row":{"en":"thank you very much","wo":"Maa ngi lay jaajëfal bu baax","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMangui lay diadieufeul bou bakh\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2065,"row":{"en":"On the one hand, machines are becoming increasingly sophisticated and capable, and they are already performing many tasks that were once thought to be the exclusive domain of humans.","wo":"Ci genn wet gi mën nañu ni masin yaa ngi gën di xarañ ak mën seen liggéey, rax ci dolli leegi masin yaa ngi def liggéey yoo xamni ñépp dañu jàppoon ni nit rek a ko mëna def.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nThi guene wét gui meune nagnou ni machine ya ngui gueune di kharagn ak meune seen ligueye, rakh thi dolli légui machine ya ngui def ligueye yoo khamni nieup daniou diapone ni nite rek a ko meuna def.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2066,"row":{"en":"absent","wo":"ku ci nekk morom ma to look each other","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nkou thi nek morom ma to look each other\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2067,"row":{"en":"Many people in The Gambia work in agriculture, fishing, or tourism.","wo":"Ñu bari ci doomi Gambia dañuy bay, napp wala ñuy yëngu ci turism.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nGnou bari si domi gambia dagnouy baye nap wala gnouy yeungue si tourisme.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2068,"row":{"en":"This concept of surrender, or Islam in Arabic, is often misunderstood as meaning submission or defeat.","wo":"Baatu topp boobu, wala Islam ci Araab, ñu bari dañu koy jaawale ak jébbalu wala defet.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBaatou top bobou wala islam si arab gnou bari dagnou koy diawalé ak diebalou wala défaite.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2069,"row":{"en":"We also received a thank-you card from the blood bank.","wo":"Waa bànku deret daal di nuy joxaale kàrtu jaajëfal.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nWaa bankou deret daldi niou diokhalé kartou diadieufal.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2070,"row":{"en":"Keep right at the fork, towards the coast, then join the path running parallel to the fence.","wo":"Jubalal soo yeggee fi yoon wi xaajaloo, nga topp yoon wi toppu ñag bi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDjoubleul so yégé fi yone wi khadjalo, nga top yone wi topou gnag bi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2071,"row":{"en":"With a little practice, you'll be able to trim your dog's nails like a pro.","wo":"Soo tàmmee dagg say wewi xaj, dinga dem ba xarañ ci.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSo tamé dag say wéwi khadj dinga dem ba kharagn si.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2072,"row":{"en":"And we should ask the wealthiest among us to contribute their fair share.","wo":"Kon noo ngi ñaan ci gëna am xaalis ci nun ñu maye seen wàll ci lii.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKon noniou ngui gnane si geuna ame khalis si nioune gnou mayé sen wall si lii.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2073,"row":{"en":"necessary","wo":"lu mën a rey","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLou meun a rey\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2074,"row":{"en":"They were drinking and laughing, enjoying each other's company, when suddenly the lights went out.","wo":"Ñu ngi doon naan ak di reetaan, ku nekk di kontaan ci moroomam, jekk saa rek làmp yépp fay.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nGnoungui done nane ak di reutane, kou nek di kontane sii moromame, dieuk saa rek lamp yeup fayé.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2075,"row":{"en":"rest in peace","wo":"yal na suuf sedd sa kaw","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nYalla na souf sedd sa kaw.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2076,"row":{"en":"Client: Yeah, it's been really tough. We're just not getting along.","wo":"Kiliyaan bi: Waaw, sunu diggante yombatul. Ànd bi neexatul.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nClient bi: waw sounou diganté yombatoul ande bi nékhatoul\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2077,"row":{"en":"It's all about doing the right thing, even when it's hard.","wo":"Mooy nga def liy yoon, doonte dafa metti.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMoy nga def li yoon, donté dafa méti.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2078,"row":{"en":"Some of us confess to a vague sense of dread as Sunday comes to a close.","wo":"Ñenn ci nun dañu melni ku xawa tiit gina