ells":[]},{"row_idx":2084,"row":{"en":"These characteristics can give you a lot of insight into how best to interact and communicate with your target market.","wo":"Màndarga yii mën nañu la yokk xel ci ni ngay def ba gëna mëna jokkoo ak say kiliyaan yi ngay wut.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMandarga yii meun nagnou la yokh hel thi ni ngay def ba geuna meuna diokoo ak say client yi ngay wout.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2085,"row":{"en":"Employer: That sounds like you have a lot of experience with math. What are your thoughts on the importance of math in the workplace?","wo":"Patroŋ bi: Danga may nuru ku am xam-xam ci wàllu math. Ban njariñ nga yaakaar ni math mën nako am ci biir liggéey bi?","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nPatron bi: Danga may nourou kou ame kham kham ci wallou math. Bane ndiarigne gua yakar ni math meune nako ame thi biir liguey bi?\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2086,"row":{"en":"The owner of the boat watched Thomas for a moment, then said, Do you want to learn how to sail?","wo":"Boroom gaal gi xool Thomas bamu yàgg muni ko, Bëgg nga njàng ni ñuy dawalee gaal?","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBorom gaal gui khol Thomas bamou yague mouni ko, beug nga ndiang ni gnuy dawalé gaal ?\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2087,"row":{"en":"Do you want wild river fish, a calm lake fish, or a stock pond farm-raised variety?","wo":"Danga bëgga jënu dexu àll, jënu dex gu tekkaaral, wala jëm yuñ yar ci mbalka ci tool?","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDanga beuga dieuneu dekhou all, dieuneu dekh gou tékaral, wala dieum yougn yar thi mbalaka thi tool ?\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2088,"row":{"en":"Elephants have a long trunk that they use for many purposes, including drinking, bathing, and gathering food.","wo":"Bakkan bu gudd la ñay yor, te ci anam yu bari la koy jëfandikoo lu ci melni suy naan, sangu wala dajale lu muy lekk.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBakane bou goud la gnay yorr té si anam you bari lako djefandiko lou si melni souy nane sangou wala dadialé loumouy lekk\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2089,"row":{"en":"The refund or exchange must be made within 14 days of purchase.","wo":"Soo jëndee bamu weesu 14 fan dootu ñu la ko mëna wecci wala delloo sa xaalis.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSo dieundé bammou wésou 14 fane dotou gnou lako meuna weuthi wala dello sa khalis.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2090,"row":{"en":"Are you still there?","wo":"Yaa ngi foofa ba léegi?","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nYaa ngui foofa ba légui ?\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2091,"row":{"en":"Green is described as being 5'6 tall, with long brown hair and green eyes.","wo":"Green mingi am 5'6 ci njoolaay, ak kawar gu maron gu gudd ak bët yu wert.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nGreen moungui ame 5'6 ci ndiolay ak kawar gou maron gou goud ak beut you wert.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2092,"row":{"en":"These chemicals react with water in the atmosphere to form acids, which then fall to the ground in rain, snow, or fog.","wo":"Substaas chimik yooyu dañuy jaxasoo ak ndox mi ci jawwu ji daal di nekk asid, mu wàcci ci suuf si ni taw, neige wala lay.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSubstaas chimik yoyou daniouy diakhaso ak ndokh mi si djaw dji daldi nek acide mou wathi si souf si ni taw, neige wala layé.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2093,"row":{"en":"Goodnight sweetheart, and I am so pleased that sleep has banished sorrow for both of us.","wo":"Sama xol, nu fanaan jàmm, di sant Yàlla bi nelaw dàqee lépp luy naqar ci sunu xol nun ñaar.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSama khol, niou fanaan diam di sant yalla bi nelaw daké lép louy nakar thi souniou khol nioune gnaar.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2094,"row":{"en":"But once my mind was finally made up, I still could not leave