i juddoo ci jàngat bu ni mel, waaye itam bu juddoo ci njuréefi jàngat boobu.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDina gnou diapé science itame ni bankhassou khamkham bi diouddo si diangat bou ni mel wayé itame bou diouddo si ndioureufi diangat bobou.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]}],"num_rows_total":3438,"num_rows_per_page":100,"partial":false}